338	    /**
339	     * Rejects an owner payload that is missing or blank in any required field. Bean Validation
340	     * already rejects {@code null} values and some formats, but a whitespace-only value can still
341	     * satisfy a {@code @Size(min = 1)} constraint; this guard catches those remaining cases.
