652	     * Rejects creation of an owner whose city already contains the maximum number of owners
653	     * ({@value #CITY_CAPACITY}). Owners are counted per city case-insensitively with surrounding and
654	     * internal whitespace collapsed, consistent with the other owner-field comparisons.
